# TDD

When building a feature or fixing a bug, follow [`.cursor/skills/tdd/`](../skills/tdd/SKILL.md).

Seams are the slice Given / When / Then (and the PRD success criteria),
not a question to a human. Red → green only; refactoring is the
`code-review` skill.

- Hold classification and drafting to the Acme key
  (`examples/acme-policy-key.md`, `tests/test_acme.py`).
- A change that writes OSCAL follows `.cursor/rules/oscal-goldens.mdc`.
- Unit tests make no network calls. E2E fakes AI providers.
- Do not weaken existing tests to make a slice pass.
